1
00:05:05,113 --> 00:05:06,126
Maari Anna!

2
00:05:06,384 --> 00:05:08,210
We’re from Aanakolli village.

3
00:05:21,087 --> 00:05:22,383
Two months ago,

4
00:05:22,497 --> 00:05:23,861
our village had over a hundred people.

5
00:05:28,985 --> 00:05:30,539
And now only seven or eight remain.

6
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:41,219
Hey!

7
00:05:41,962 --> 00:05:43,242
If you help us, Maari Anna...

8
00:05:43,509 --> 00:05:44,835
Our Aanakolli will be safe.

9
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:03,844
From what I’ve heard,
Aanakolli has plenty of elephants.

10
00:06:05,067 --> 00:06:06,963
If we hunt down the rogue tusker...

11
00:06:07,535 --> 00:06:08,815
the forest is ours!

12
00:06:16,456 --> 00:06:17,402
Let's go.

13
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:45,223
The ferocious tusker fell down.

14
00:08:46,592 --> 00:08:48,391
From Kerala and Tamil Nadu...

15
00:08:48,416 --> 00:08:50,952
Maari annan deployed hunters
across in Aanakolli.

16
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:56,840
I’m one of them those who came here.

17
00:08:59,746 --> 00:09:01,266
Forty-five hunters…

18
00:09:01,469 --> 00:09:02,825
along with their families

19
00:09:03,286 --> 00:09:04,499
They’re clever.

20
00:09:06,445 --> 00:09:08,366
Don’t let anyone step outside.

21
00:09:09,017 --> 00:09:10,027
The tusks…

22
00:09:10,234 --> 00:09:11,680
...must end up in our hands.

23
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,070
And the food…

24
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:17,516
I’ll take care of it.

25
00:09:19,549 --> 00:09:22,029
We hunted elephants in the forest
and took their tusks.

26
00:09:23,237 --> 00:09:24,937
Every tusk reaches Maari Anna

27
00:10:45,052 --> 00:10:46,402
'White Gold’

28
00:10:47,188 --> 00:10:49,080
That’s what Maari Anna named those tusks.

29
00:10:51,231 --> 00:10:54,230
The entire shipment was routed
through Rameswaram to Jaffna.

30
00:11:03,259 --> 00:11:05,259
Even the police and forest department...

31
00:11:05,466 --> 00:11:07,125
were under Maari annan’s control.

32
00:11:25,175 --> 00:11:29,333
Maari annan became a key figure
for the ivory smugglers.

33
00:11:37,461 --> 00:11:38,461
Soon...

34
00:11:39,356 --> 00:11:41,223
Cartel's been taken by the Maari annan...

35
00:13:11,393 --> 00:13:12,313
Ali brother!

36
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,714
That’s impossible!

37
00:13:16,903 --> 00:13:18,610
Don’t stop! Keep moving!

38
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:01,185
Escaped?

39
00:14:02,109 --> 00:14:03,175
Sorry sir.

40
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:05,050
I don't like confessions, Velraj.

41
00:14:07,374 --> 00:14:08,814
Did you check the vehicle?

42
00:14:09,066 --> 00:14:09,939
Yes sir.

43
00:14:09,952 --> 00:14:11,551
- Tusks?
- Yeah, it's there.

44
00:15:37,762 --> 00:15:38,921
Stanley!

45
00:16:14,661 --> 00:16:16,389
Did anyone see?

46
00:16:17,421 --> 00:16:18,594
No, anna.

47
00:16:19,137 --> 00:16:21,003
No one saw us.

48
00:16:40,688 --> 00:16:43,040
Twenty-five Tusks!

49
00:16:44,166 --> 00:16:45,943
Do you know how many crores that is?

50
00:16:47,373 --> 00:16:48,833
Ali?

51
00:16:50,203 --> 00:16:51,870
Feels like a tip-off,

52
00:16:52,721 --> 00:16:56,713
Nothing like this has ever happened before,

53
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:01,163
There was no issue at the check post,

54
00:17:01,977 --> 00:17:03,716
The police showed up only after Theni.

55
00:17:28,274 --> 00:17:29,024
Mom...

56
00:17:30,047 --> 00:17:30,978
Leave me.

57
00:17:37,540 --> 00:17:38,535
Dad?

58
00:19:23,334 --> 00:19:27,027
The seized shipment had five A-grade tusks,

59
00:19:27,149 --> 00:19:28,383
I had stashed in Wayanad.

60
00:19:29,077 --> 00:19:30,783
Each one’s worth three and a half crores…

61
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,798
You’re aware of that, Maari Anna.

62
00:19:33,628 --> 00:19:34,494
Maari anna.

63
00:19:34,514 --> 00:19:36,443
I’ve been getting a lot
of orders from Nepal.

64
00:19:36,581 --> 00:19:39,198
But you know… I haven’t supplied them yet.

65
00:19:39,471 --> 00:19:40,879
Don’t worry… I won’t betray you.

66
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:42,160
I trust you.

67
00:19:42,408 --> 00:19:44,721
But if our shipment keep
getting seized like this…

68
00:19:45,851 --> 00:19:46,864
Then...

69
00:19:47,118 --> 00:19:48,934
If there’s no solution,

70
00:19:49,472 --> 00:19:51,038
I will have to answer to the higher-ups

71
00:19:51,222 --> 00:19:52,674
I don't have any choice.

72
00:19:57,173 --> 00:19:58,540
<i>A message from Cabral.</i>

73
00:19:58,847 --> 00:20:01,264
<i>The shipments should reach
Rameshwaram when I need them.</i>

74
00:20:01,509 --> 00:20:02,677
<i>That’s your job.</i>

75
00:20:02,811 --> 00:20:04,477
If you can’t handle it,

76
00:20:04,502 --> 00:20:06,275
someone else will.

77
00:20:06,693 --> 00:20:08,234
<i>There won’t be any chances given.</i>

78
00:20:08,589 --> 00:20:09,589
<i>Be mindful.</i>

79
00:20:13,308 --> 00:20:15,754
I warned you not to send Eddie that day.

80
00:20:15,932 --> 00:20:17,338
He’s the one playing against us.

81
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:20,230
The new Tamil Nadu
Forest Minister is on his side.

82
00:20:20,587 --> 00:20:22,659
And the SP who seized
our shipment yesterday,

83
00:20:22,775 --> 00:20:23,981
Nelson Nadar

84
00:20:24,055 --> 00:20:25,303
Nelson Nadar is his brother-in-law.

85
00:20:26,013 --> 00:20:28,813
That sudden transfer from Idukki to Theni,

86
00:20:29,334 --> 00:20:30,727
...was Eddie's brain behind it.

87
00:20:32,626 --> 00:20:33,892
That name...

88
00:20:34,158 --> 00:20:35,585
Don’t say it here.

89
00:20:37,122 --> 00:20:38,755
This is my cartel.

90
00:20:40,548 --> 00:20:42,756
No one takes a loss.

91
00:20:43,575 --> 00:20:45,822
Before dawn breaks tomorrow...

92
00:20:45,847 --> 00:20:47,773
the next shipment will reach Rameshwaram.

93
00:20:51,174 --> 00:20:52,193
With...

94
00:20:52,614 --> 00:20:54,521
A-grade ivorys.

95
00:21:13,482 --> 00:21:14,475
Johny!

96
00:21:15,446 --> 00:21:17,172
Load all the tusks into the vehicle.

97
00:21:17,806 --> 00:21:19,532
I'll also head to Rameshwaram.

98
00:21:20,427 --> 00:21:21,767
Whoever it is,

99
00:21:22,953 --> 00:21:23,955
we'll deal with them.

100
00:22:56,255 --> 00:22:57,981
Back then, he set out
to kill the rogue elephant

101
00:22:58,006 --> 00:22:59,354
and bring the forest
under his control...

102
00:23:00,162 --> 00:23:02,248
He's Eddie’s father, Joseph from Idukki.

103
00:23:03,450 --> 00:23:05,177
Right before his eyes...

104
00:23:06,978 --> 00:23:09,089
The rogue tusker killed
Joseph with his tusk.

105
00:23:13,066 --> 00:23:15,777
From then on, Eddie began
following his father’s wishes.

106
00:23:30,741 --> 00:23:31,874
What's it, Maari?

107
00:23:32,815 --> 00:23:33,994
All good?

108
00:23:35,761 --> 00:23:37,761
For a deceased father,

109
00:23:39,044 --> 00:23:41,579
do you know what a son's prayer is?

110
00:23:43,061 --> 00:23:44,254
Do you know, Maari?

111
00:23:46,599 --> 00:23:48,479
Whatever his father wished for…

112
00:23:49,385 --> 00:23:51,124
...a son must fulfill it.

113
00:23:56,776 --> 00:23:58,776
I’ll make it happen.

114
00:24:02,339 --> 00:24:03,219
This forest...

115
00:24:03,846 --> 00:24:04,785
This cartel...

116
00:24:06,112 --> 00:24:07,884
The tusks you've hidden...

117
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:12,266
and you along with it.

118
00:24:13,473 --> 00:24:14,966
I’ll finish it.

119
00:24:32,140 --> 00:24:33,991
He’s got a snake’s destiny…

120
00:24:35,361 --> 00:24:36,493
He is not easy to kill.

121
00:24:42,245 --> 00:24:43,279
But the shipment…

122
00:24:44,105 --> 00:24:45,107
Eddie took it.

123
00:24:57,798 --> 00:24:58,630
Brother.

124
00:24:58,895 --> 00:25:00,068
Minister’s here already!

125
00:25:21,277 --> 00:25:22,397
What's it, Eddie?

126
00:25:22,422 --> 00:25:23,761
Did Maari escape?

127
00:25:25,950 --> 00:25:27,156
Forget that.

128
00:25:27,662 --> 00:25:29,375
We have the tusk, right?

129
00:25:29,441 --> 00:25:30,328
Yes

130
00:25:31,977 --> 00:25:33,543
Got a call from Cabral.

131
00:25:34,756 --> 00:25:36,495
Our shipment has reached Jaffna.

132
00:25:37,466 --> 00:25:38,719
The next shipment...

133
00:25:38,860 --> 00:25:40,019
forty tusks.

134
00:25:40,876 --> 00:25:41,749
But...

135
00:25:42,119 --> 00:25:44,066
This shipment is bound for Gujarat.

136
00:25:44,865 --> 00:25:46,105
The vehicle come from there…

137
00:25:46,705 --> 00:25:48,594
we just need to escort it.

138
00:25:49,158 --> 00:25:52,334
Why not use our truck?

139
00:25:52,483 --> 00:25:53,403
No Eddie.

140
00:25:53,875 --> 00:25:55,121
From here to Gujarat,

141
00:25:55,309 --> 00:25:56,329
Risk is too high.

142
00:25:57,292 --> 00:25:59,912
That vehicle has a different chassis
and a different body.

143
00:26:00,777 --> 00:26:02,585
The driver’s from Gujarat.

144
00:26:03,013 --> 00:26:05,013
Even if it gets caught,
we're safe.

145
00:26:07,329 --> 00:26:09,317
Escort it safely!

146
00:26:12,889 --> 00:26:14,409
Relax Eddie!

147
00:26:14,902 --> 00:26:16,601
The cartel is ours.

148
00:26:17,580 --> 00:26:19,264
The Cabral deal is ours too.

149
00:26:39,740 --> 00:26:40,846
Our shipment…

150
00:26:41,206 --> 00:26:42,930
they’re transporting it to Gujarat.

151
00:26:44,900 --> 00:26:45,774
Nadhu.

152
00:27:02,537 --> 00:27:04,441
So, we need to retrieve the tusks.

153
00:27:07,465 --> 00:27:08,504
from Gujarat.

154
00:27:09,154 --> 00:27:10,149
Yes.

155
00:27:10,174 --> 00:27:12,041
The truck’s coming from Gujarat.

156
00:27:12,604 --> 00:27:14,022
Return to Gujarat.

157
00:27:14,345 --> 00:27:16,293
Driver’s from gujarat too.

158
00:27:17,033 --> 00:27:17,772
Hmm!

159
00:27:18,414 --> 00:27:19,763
There’s a guy, Maari…

160
00:27:28,544 --> 00:27:30,661
One of my best peddlers.

161
00:27:36,378 --> 00:27:39,560
Like a hawk swooping down on a chick…

162
00:27:39,959 --> 00:27:41,480
He’ll snatch that shipment.

163
00:28:11,134 --> 00:28:12,595
The notorious Saint...

164
00:28:19,779 --> 00:28:20,967
Antony!

165
00:30:22,706 --> 00:30:23,616
Brother!

166
00:30:25,333 --> 00:30:26,833
The truck started from Gujarat.

167
00:30:27,578 --> 00:30:28,471
Okay

168
00:30:43,583 --> 00:30:44,516
Hurry!

169
00:30:44,935 --> 00:30:46,192
Ensure the shipment is safe.

170
00:30:57,486 --> 00:30:58,734
Go carefully!

171
00:31:00,174 --> 00:31:01,338
Whether you live or die,

172
00:31:01,570 --> 00:31:03,292
my goods must reach safely.

173
00:31:06,532 --> 00:31:07,641
Got it?

174
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:37,593
He has already left from here.

175
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:40,360
Yes, yes, our escort is also with them.

176
00:31:47,081 --> 00:31:49,242
I will inform you as soon
as when they reach Mumbai.

177
00:33:56,740 --> 00:33:58,906
Not even a single shipment
from AanaAanakolli reaches...

178
00:33:58,930 --> 00:34:01,095
Rameshwaram without
passing through Theni.

179
00:34:01,794 --> 00:34:06,473
Antony, they called you
here to sneak it past Eddie.

180
00:34:10,043 --> 00:34:12,823
Back then, the ones who
brought Maari anna to this Aanakolli…

181
00:34:13,190 --> 00:34:16,796
He killed them by hanging and
burned them alive, and ruled this forest.

182
00:34:26,136 --> 00:34:31,373
He even killed Hakeem and Maruthu
his own men when they asked for a share.

183
00:34:46,687 --> 00:34:49,041
All Maari anna wants… is the tusks.

184
00:34:49,387 --> 00:34:53,286
He doesn’t care who’s by his side.

185
00:34:54,943 --> 00:34:57,090
To bear Maari annan’s blows and disgrace…

186
00:34:57,549 --> 00:34:58,823
We can’t do this anymore.

187
00:35:00,425 --> 00:35:01,998
This Aanakolli is ours.

188
00:35:02,939 --> 00:35:06,490
I know why Antony is here.

189
00:35:11,152 --> 00:35:12,312
If you’re with us…

190
00:35:14,184 --> 00:35:15,710
We’ll stand with you.

191
00:35:28,335 --> 00:35:29,855
I told you, Antony.

192
00:35:30,414 --> 00:35:31,579
Eddie is the problem.

193
00:35:32,217 --> 00:35:34,422
With the Minister and the new SP,

194
00:35:34,856 --> 00:35:36,119
He’s the one ruining the plans.

195
00:35:39,568 --> 00:35:41,436
I’ll lose the cartel.

196
00:35:42,905 --> 00:35:44,978
I’ve pleaded with Cabral.

197
00:35:45,381 --> 00:35:46,624
One last chance.

198
00:35:46,778 --> 00:35:47,778
Eddie,

199
00:35:47,977 --> 00:35:49,791
I’ve already requested Cabral.

200
00:35:50,070 --> 00:35:51,541
The next shipment is important to us.

201
00:35:52,006 --> 00:35:54,534
The consignment must
reach Jaffna, no matter what.

202
00:35:54,862 --> 00:35:56,716
Only then will the cartel be ours.

203
00:35:57,596 --> 00:35:59,261
The next shipment is crucial.

204
00:35:59,555 --> 00:36:01,342
It’s enough if the shipment crosses Theni.

205
00:36:01,764 --> 00:36:03,266
I’ll take care of the rest.

206
00:36:04,118 --> 00:36:05,133
For that,

207
00:36:06,266 --> 00:36:07,888
I need your help.

208
00:36:12,413 --> 00:36:13,158
Brother,

209
00:36:13,183 --> 00:36:14,683
I’ve checked his background.

210
00:36:15,241 --> 00:36:16,703
Between Mumbai and Goa,

211
00:36:16,728 --> 00:36:18,276
there’s a transport agency…

212
00:36:18,657 --> 00:36:21,930
He’s just a peddler, nothing more.

213
00:36:22,285 --> 00:36:23,762
You can do this, Antony.

214
00:36:24,319 --> 00:36:25,649
I trust you.

215
00:36:27,687 --> 00:36:29,145
Tell me if you need anything!

216
00:36:30,526 --> 00:36:31,648
Antony!

217
00:36:33,272 --> 00:36:34,756
No matter who tries to stop us...

218
00:36:35,552 --> 00:36:38,705
Our shipment will go to Jaffna.

219
00:36:47,626 --> 00:36:48,939
Let Eddie make his plan

220
00:36:51,332 --> 00:36:53,047
God likes to mess...

221
00:36:55,581 --> 00:36:56,887
with the devil’s plans.

222
00:37:21,869 --> 00:37:23,032
Is this how you do it, brat?

223
00:37:28,448 --> 00:37:29,755
Why not carve the eyes?!

224
00:37:31,977 --> 00:37:32,882
Hey!

225
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:36,237
Make sure everything’s ready by tomorrow.

226
00:38:12,641 --> 00:38:15,303
They say the Lord Ganapati, carved
from tusk, holds immense power.

227
00:38:52,093 --> 00:38:52,965
Run!

228
00:38:52,990 --> 00:38:54,112
Leave me, Antony!

229
00:38:54,780 --> 00:38:55,952
If we get caught, it's over.

230
00:38:55,977 --> 00:38:57,132
A road unknown to me…

231
00:38:57,322 --> 00:38:58,676
People I don’t know…

232
00:38:58,701 --> 00:39:00,239
You were supposed to stay with me.

233
00:39:01,341 --> 00:39:03,091
There are crores worth of goods here,

234
00:39:04,189 --> 00:39:06,687
Do you think we can just
hand it over to those guys?

235
00:39:08,729 --> 00:39:10,165
What’s all this chattering?

236
00:39:13,675 --> 00:39:14,861
Step outside

237
00:39:26,049 --> 00:39:27,509
What’s hiding in vehicle?

238
00:39:30,981 --> 00:39:32,586
Check it, see what's there.

239
00:39:46,984 --> 00:39:47,917
Sir,

240
00:39:48,489 --> 00:39:49,610
Nothing’s here.

241
00:39:58,037 --> 00:40:00,734
We’re going to get the
shipments from Madurai, sir

242
00:40:04,774 --> 00:40:06,007
Antony,

243
00:40:06,046 --> 00:40:07,203
I know well

244
00:40:07,621 --> 00:40:10,116
Maari has brought someone formidable here.

245
00:40:12,931 --> 00:40:14,037
Not you…

246
00:40:14,515 --> 00:40:16,828
even if Saint Anthony himself comes,

247
00:40:17,588 --> 00:40:20,941
won’t cross Theni and take
that shipment to Rameshwaram.

248
00:40:23,776 --> 00:40:29,489
Sir, let me see if I can cross the
Theni border with the saint’s help.

249
00:40:32,561 --> 00:40:33,652
Try your luck!

250
00:41:09,251 --> 00:41:11,657
Eddie’s load will never reach Jaffna.

251
00:41:11,896 --> 00:41:13,682
Before Eddie could sketch us out,

252
00:41:14,455 --> 00:41:16,137
I already made a move on him.

253
00:41:16,954 --> 00:41:18,520
Call Cabral now.

254
00:41:19,307 --> 00:41:20,447
Five days

255
00:41:20,919 --> 00:41:22,319
In five days,

256
00:41:22,889 --> 00:41:24,747
our shipment will reach Jaffna.

257
00:42:08,714 --> 00:42:10,961
That Anthony isn’t what we thought.

258
00:42:12,216 --> 00:42:13,248
Roby.

259
00:42:17,343 --> 00:42:18,306
Brother,

260
00:42:19,184 --> 00:42:20,614
Don't stop me.

261
00:42:21,763 --> 00:42:24,898
That Anthony… he has to be finished!

262
00:42:26,330 --> 00:42:28,802
He must pay for taking our shipment.

263
00:42:31,034 --> 00:42:32,435
He must be punished!

264
00:42:34,135 --> 00:42:35,637
Don’t act rashly.

265
00:42:38,094 --> 00:42:39,205
Antony,

266
00:42:40,897 --> 00:42:42,385
He’s just a lackey.

267
00:42:44,065 --> 00:42:45,368
When you strike,

268
00:42:45,741 --> 00:42:47,181
aim for the head.

269
00:42:49,389 --> 00:42:51,143
Antony isn’t enough…

270
00:42:54,289 --> 00:42:55,583
Maari will fall too.

271
00:42:55,608 --> 00:42:57,096
What Eddie said is right,

272
00:42:57,548 --> 00:42:59,321
Just be a little patience, brother

273
00:43:01,662 --> 00:43:03,430
When the right time comes,

274
00:43:04,109 --> 00:43:05,277
Nicely...

275
00:43:05,888 --> 00:43:07,419
