It was his plan.

541
01:11:48,377 --> 01:11:50,316
The situation is critical.

542
01:11:50,496 --> 01:11:52,509
Everyone has internal bleeding…

543
01:11:52,627 --> 01:11:54,368
multiple organs are also weak.

544
01:11:54,743 --> 01:11:57,793
The child and others will require surgery.

545
01:11:58,500 --> 01:12:00,832
As you know, this is a private hospital.

546
01:12:01,025 --> 01:12:04,831
We can proceed only
if some payment is made.

547
01:12:05,455 --> 01:12:08,850
Otherwise, you’ll have to
shift to a government hospital.

548
01:12:11,264 --> 01:12:12,797
No need to shift them.

549
01:12:13,338 --> 01:12:14,698
I’ll pay some now

550
01:12:15,598 --> 01:12:16,935
I'll settle the rest later

551
01:12:20,366 --> 01:12:22,206
Where will you get the money, Antony?

552
01:12:26,967 --> 01:12:28,817
Everyone deserves to live,
right Ali ikka?

553
01:12:29,828 --> 01:12:31,481
Let's ask the one who has the money.

554
01:12:35,463 --> 01:12:36,983
If it’s fifteen crores rupees, I’m in!

555
01:12:37,635 --> 01:12:38,528
A-grade

556
01:12:39,118 --> 01:12:40,705
It’ll be dispatched within two weeks.

557
01:12:42,581 --> 01:12:43,861
Glad to hear that.

558
01:12:48,787 --> 01:12:50,006
How did it go?

559
01:12:50,929 --> 01:12:52,336
Everything okay?

560
01:12:52,467 --> 01:12:54,040
Anna, Sainu is currently in the ICU.

561
01:12:55,152 --> 01:12:57,019
Everyone’s condition is bad.

562
01:12:58,085 --> 01:13:00,307
They’ll treat them only
if we arrange the money.

563
01:13:02,344 --> 01:13:03,990
Anna, please arrange the money.

564
01:13:04,473 --> 01:13:05,413
Money?

565
01:13:06,593 --> 01:13:07,546
How much?

566
01:13:07,993 --> 01:13:09,438
Twenty lakhs.

567
01:13:10,656 --> 01:13:11,549
What?

568
01:13:14,898 --> 01:13:16,571
If you give us atleast twenty lakhs…

569
01:13:16,596 --> 01:13:17,464
Hey!

570
01:13:17,905 --> 01:13:19,345
Are you messing with me?

571
01:13:20,428 --> 01:13:22,227
I’m paying you monthly, aren’t I?

572
01:13:22,840 --> 01:13:23,806
Money!

573
01:13:26,190 --> 01:13:27,237
Nadhu.

574
01:13:40,447 --> 01:13:41,774
Here, fifty thousands

575
01:13:42,968 --> 01:13:45,707
That’s all the life it’s worth.

576
01:13:48,028 --> 01:13:51,307
My child, who I prayed for, for
twenty years, is lying in the hospital.

577
01:13:53,459 --> 01:13:56,105
and all those innocent lives
worked for you all these years.

578
01:13:58,926 --> 01:14:00,840
We don’t need your petty money now.

579
01:14:08,374 --> 01:14:09,293
Take it!

580
01:14:09,847 --> 01:14:10,858
Take that money!

581
01:14:11,440 --> 01:14:12,677
Take it… you lowlife!

582
01:14:14,411 --> 01:14:15,679
What are you staring at?

583
01:14:21,896 --> 01:14:23,176
Antony!

584
01:14:26,411 --> 01:14:27,560
We don’t want credit.

585
01:14:28,543 --> 01:14:30,118
Just give us the deal you promised

586
01:14:31,213 --> 01:14:32,333
that’s enough.

587
01:14:32,730 --> 01:14:33,817
What, huh?

588
01:14:33,917 --> 01:14:35,503
You’ve come to strike a deal?

589
01:14:36,165 --> 01:14:39,591
Many came to me for deals before…

590
01:14:41,035 --> 01:14:42,948
None of them are here now.

591
01:14:44,837 --> 01:14:46,874
This is Theni SP’s territory now.

592
01:14:47,836 --> 01:14:49,516
He handles everything.

593
01:14:50,296 --> 01:14:51,683
No more business here for you.

594
01:14:52,311 --> 01:14:54,643
Leave this place… now.

595
01:15:18,212 --> 01:15:20,418
Too many innocents have died by my hands.

596
01:15:22,698 --> 01:15:26,519
What happened to Sainu…
must be the price for my mistakes.

597
01:15:29,243 --> 01:15:30,871
If anything happens...

598
01:15:31,897 --> 01:15:34,451
No one here has any path forward in life.

599
01:15:36,981 --> 01:15:38,981
As this Aanakolli Maari knows…

600
01:15:39,643 --> 01:15:41,007
You all know it here… don’t you?

601
01:15:44,659 --> 01:15:45,829
If there’s no way… then…

602
01:15:46,620 --> 01:15:48,762
Then we’ll have to carve
that path ourselves, Ali ikka.

603
01:18:20,711 --> 01:18:22,410
Have you decided to go to Sri Lanka?

604
01:18:23,039 --> 01:18:25,518
There’s a contact of mine there.
The deal will go through.

605
01:18:26,734 --> 01:18:28,234
I’ll call the harbour.

606
01:18:28,259 --> 01:18:29,259
Salim

607
01:18:29,499 --> 01:18:30,793
He will arrange the boat.

608
01:19:06,918 --> 01:19:07,939
Ali told me.

609
01:19:08,275 --> 01:19:09,275
Did you bring the money?

610
01:19:09,288 --> 01:19:10,114
Yes

611
01:19:10,128 --> 01:19:10,801
Come

612
01:19:12,158 --> 01:19:14,325
A few are on the boat.
Hand them two lakhs.

613
01:19:14,350 --> 01:19:15,857
They’re our people.

614
01:19:16,111 --> 01:19:17,004
Kali.

615
01:19:22,792 --> 01:19:24,878
No matter what,
the goods are safe with us.

616
01:19:26,940 --> 01:19:28,892
He’s one of ours. Take him with you.

617
01:19:30,226 --> 01:19:31,152
Go ahead.

618
01:19:55,313 --> 01:19:56,173
Salim

619
01:19:56,792 --> 01:19:59,419
Make sure he doesn’t reach Sri Lanka.

620
01:19:59,988 --> 01:20:00,752
Okay

621
01:20:19,867 --> 01:20:20,780
Hey, Das!

622
01:20:21,341 --> 01:20:23,187
Finish that Antony inside

623
01:23:42,201 --> 01:23:42,814
Hey!

624
01:23:43,766 --> 01:23:45,032
This is our territory.

625
01:23:45,132 --> 01:23:47,055
You can’t escape anywhere.

626
01:26:27,694 --> 01:26:28,895
What about the deal?

627
01:26:29,570 --> 01:26:31,070
Straight to Trincomalee

628
01:26:31,833 --> 01:26:33,233
Cabral’s rival gang.

629
01:26:33,508 --> 01:26:34,901
They’ve got a gangster.

630
01:26:36,650 --> 01:26:37,729
Mendis.

631
01:26:52,676 --> 01:26:55,190
If luck’s on our side,
Mendis will take our tusks.

632
01:26:56,607 --> 01:26:57,773
What if not?

633
01:26:59,567 --> 01:27:00,947
There’s no coming back for us.

634
01:27:06,260 --> 01:27:08,073
Let's take the risk, man.

635
01:27:47,850 --> 01:27:50,177
Make sure, he won't survive.

636
01:27:51,962 --> 01:27:53,962
I want his damn head!

637
01:27:54,129 --> 01:27:55,479
You'll get it, Eddie.

638
01:30:30,919 --> 01:30:32,066
What you want?

639
01:30:32,373 --> 01:30:33,706
To meet Mendis

640
01:30:33,958 --> 01:30:35,069
For what?

641
01:30:35,600 --> 01:30:37,373
We have got some stuff with us.

642
01:30:38,005 --> 01:30:39,071
You wanna see?

643
01:30:39,096 --> 01:30:40,242
What stuff?

644
01:30:41,063 --> 01:30:42,203
Ivorys!

645
01:30:45,123 --> 01:30:46,129
Show me.

646
01:31:43,028 --> 01:31:44,714
A-grade Ivorys.

647
01:31:45,775 --> 01:31:47,075
Where did you get it from?

648
01:31:47,578 --> 01:31:48,203
Huh?

649
01:31:48,661 --> 01:31:49,561
From Kerala

650
01:31:49,602 --> 01:31:51,428
This is a really beautiful man.

651
01:31:53,546 --> 01:31:55,546
It's real white gold, huh?

652
01:31:56,889 --> 01:31:58,288
We will make a deal.

653
01:31:59,866 --> 01:32:02,946
If you get me more white gold from Kerala.

654
01:32:08,998 --> 01:32:09,851
Okay

655
01:32:10,463 --> 01:32:11,522
Aloka,

656
01:32:11,715 --> 01:32:12,963
Give them money.

657
01:32:14,861 --> 01:32:16,160
Finish everything

658
01:32:23,623 --> 01:32:24,690
Please don't.

659
01:32:25,616 --> 01:32:26,349
My girl

660
01:32:33,522 --> 01:32:34,642
Mom...

661
01:32:38,287 --> 01:32:39,287
Mom...

662
01:34:47,969 --> 01:34:50,476
After all these years of
working hard for Maari,

663
01:34:52,785 --> 01:34:54,235
what did everyone get?

664
01:34:56,560 --> 01:34:58,621
Not by taking his kicks and insults…

665
01:35:00,857 --> 01:35:02,537
but by rising above him and living.

666
01:35:08,776 --> 01:35:10,255
If you are with me,

667
01:35:10,844 --> 01:35:12,750
Maari won’t dare step
onto this land again.

668
01:35:16,621 --> 01:35:18,381
No one here will speak, Antony.

669
01:35:19,087 --> 01:35:21,906
For 30 years, this land has
lived in fear of Maari.

670
01:35:23,165 --> 01:35:24,625
It won’t go away.

671
01:35:44,253 --> 01:35:46,413
I made this with just two tusks.

672
01:35:47,770 --> 01:35:52,171
The horns that pinned Maari
in this land... are yours.

673
01:35:53,978 --> 01:35:56,332
Are you the ones who can
bring down a musth tusker…

674
01:35:58,039 --> 01:35:59,493
afraid to even touch Maari?

675
01:36:23,195 --> 01:36:24,061
Anna.

676
01:37:23,683 --> 01:37:24,698
Antony.

677
01:37:31,551 --> 01:37:33,723
What happened after
you took Karikalan’s tusks?

678
01:37:33,828 --> 01:37:36,042
Didn’t they all end up dead?

679
01:37:36,107 --> 01:37:37,380
If you stand with him,

680
01:37:37,947 --> 01:37:39,680
more of you will die here.

681
01:37:45,340 --> 01:37:48,653
Maari anna wants your head brought to him.

682
01:40:09,635 --> 01:40:10,781
Open the chamber!

683
01:41:05,100 --> 01:41:06,586
The treasure of Aanakolli.

684
01:41:56,547 --> 01:41:57,520
Maari.

685
01:42:02,082 --> 01:42:03,774
To bury my brother…

686
01:42:07,440 --> 01:42:10,313
I need Antony.

687
01:43:33,523 --> 01:43:34,703
Where is Antony?

688
01:48:17,919 --> 01:48:19,851
Now I can bury my brother!

689
01:48:35,185 --> 01:48:36,279
Lucy

690
01:48:36,978 --> 01:48:38,702
The tusks meant for
Mendis have been found.

691
01:48:41,951 --> 01:48:43,391
But in Aanakolli,

692
01:48:45,645 --> 01:48:47,271
I need a backup.

693
01:48:51,408 --> 01:48:52,761
He will have backup.

694
01:50:18,953 --> 01:50:19,793
Hey!

695
01:50:20,559 --> 01:50:21,687
Here, you…

696
01:50:22,331 --> 01:50:24,958
I know you didn’t come
here for these people.

697
01:50:26,406 --> 01:50:28,719
Did you come for the cartel?

698
01:50:31,327 --> 01:50:32,306
Come on.

699
01:52:15,125 --> 01:52:18,625
I know why Antony is here.

700
01:52:22,525 --> 01:52:23,538
If you’re with us…

701
01:52:25,513 --> 01:52:26,927
We’ll be with you too.

702
01:53:57,637 --> 01:53:58,552
George,

703
01:53:59,419 --> 01:54:01,970
If a rat gets into the granary…

704
01:54:02,150 --> 01:54:03,623
what do we do, george?

705
01:54:05,878 --> 01:54:07,458
We’ll kill them, right?

706
01:54:08,338 --> 01:54:09,529
Kill that rat!

707
01:54:09,801 --> 01:54:11,941
I want my f****ing cartel back.

708
01:54:42,850 --> 01:54:47,084
Subtitles by SapTitles

709
01:55:21,943 --> 01:55:23,317
But for me, this is halal.

710
01:55:44,765 --> 01:55:45,872
♪ Is this the law of the wild? ♪

711
01:55:45,897 --> 01:55:47,186
♪ Or your watch, O Time? ♪

712
01:55:47,211 --> 01:55:49,566
♪ The sky burns with golden embers. ♪

713
01:55:49,656 --> 01:55:52,189
♪ The midnight wind moves ♪
♪ to the rhythm of a raging rain. ♪

714
01:55:52,214 --> 01:55:54,676
♪ Hold both the beginning ♪
♪ and the end in your hands. ♪

715
01:55:54,860 --> 01:55:57,166
♪ Demonic essence ♪
♪ that thrives on blood. ♪

716
01:55:57,199 --> 01:55:59,747
♪ Carry the blazing path ♪
♪ of fire within your heart. ♪

717
01:55:59,889 --> 01:56:02,342
♪ Like lightning ♪
♪ veiled beneath storm clouds. ♪

718
01:56:02,367 --> 01:56:04,555
♪ A living hell ♪
♪ to the eyes and ears. ♪

719
01:56:04,580 --> 01:56:06,395
♪ When he sets foot down, ♪
♪ the earth itself trembles. ♪

720
01:56:06,975 --> 01:56:08,927
♪ Who dares go on ♪
♪ to rewrite fate? ♪

721
01:56:09,609 --> 01:56:13,892
♪ He will rise, ♪
♪ spreading higher and higher. ♪

722
01:56:14,542 --> 01:56:16,482
♪ When his feet strike the ground, ♪
♪ the world trembles. ♪

723
01:56:17,069 --> 01:56:19,149
♪ Who will dare ♪
♪ to challenge fate? ♪

724
01:56:19,749 --> 01:56:22,809
♪ He shall rise, ♪
♪ climbing ever higher. ♪

725
01:56:28,490 --> 01:56:31,251
♪ On a forest path ♪
♪ that offered no way through. ♪

726
01:56:31,276 --> 01:56:33,809
♪ Is this the fierce Tandava ♪
♪ of the sky-clad one ♪

727
01:56:38,987 --> 01:56:41,349
♪ Through the pathways of a heart ♪
♪ untouched by vengeance. ♪

728
01:56:41,449 --> 01:56:44,022
♪ Is it the fierce spirit ♪
♪ of a beast in battle? ♪

